<title>UK: Morrison names John Down managing director.</title>
<headline>Morrison names John Down managing director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British stores group Wm Morrison Supermarkets Plc said on Thursday that Ken Morrison had stepped down as managing director after 40 years in the post.</p>
<p>The company said Morrison would retain his position of executive chairman. John Dowd, a director of the company since 1983, will take over as managing director.</p>
<p>Morrisons said Dowd had been with the company for 25 years.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
